Optional OCR module (libjpdfium_ocr, built only when ONNX Runtime is fetched):
- ONNX Runtime 1.30.0 - MIT (shipped beside the module, with its LICENSE and
  ThirdPartyNotices.txt)
- OpenCV 4.10 - Apache-2.0: resize, warpPerspective, findContours, convexHull,
  minAreaRect, boxPoints and fillPoly are ported in native/ocr/src/cv_compat.cpp
  (Apache-2.0 text: native/licenses/QPDF-APACHE-2.0.txt)
- Clipper 6.4.2 - BSL-1.0: polygon offsetting ported in native/ocr/src/paddle.cpp
  (native/licenses/CLIPPER-BSL-1.0.txt)
- PP-OCRv6 small models (PaddlePaddle) - Apache-2.0, fetched by digest at build
  time (native/ocr/fetch-onnxruntime.sh, native/ocr/tools/fetch_profile.py),
  not bundled

